self.KB_CONTENT["card:717374"]={"id":"card:717374","ty":"card","sourceId":"717374","title":"製程、途程傻傻分不清楚? 快打開來看!","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","產品","製程"],"y":"other","answer":"本課程將說明: 1.製程代號的設定 2.製程途程有何不同? 3.產品途程的設定 4.品號資料設定標準途程品號、代號","links":[{"url":"http://es.digiwin.com/kbvideos/callcenter/製程、途程傻傻分不清楚 快打開來看!.mp4","kind":"影音"}],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:755215"]={"id":"card:755215","ty":"card","sourceId":"755215","title":"『品號資料建立作業』中的『屬性代碼四 (MB136)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","屬性","代碼"],"y":"other","answer":"* 在程式的畫面上顯示的是屬性代碼名稱。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
